<title>USA: Engelhard widens leadership in catalysts.</title>
<headline>Engelhard widens leadership in catalysts.</headline>
<dateline>ISELIN, N.J. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engelhard Corp said Wednesday it widened its market-share leadership in auto-emission catalysts after it reported second quarter earnings of $0.31 a share on revenues of $897 million.</p>
<p>The company said it gained new business for its auto-emission catalysts from both American and European automakers.</p>
<p>Engelhard said operating earnings in the catalysts and chemicals segment rose 11 percent to $37.8 million and sales rose 13 percent to $233 million.</p>
